** Practice deck: a small aggregate plant, PM10, Albany NY met (1-4 March 1988)
** For learning only. Emission rates and stack parameters are made up.
CO STARTING
   TITLEONE Practice: small aggregate plant, PM10
   TITLETWO Dryer stack, crusher vent, storage pile and haul road
   MODELOPT DFAULT CONC
   AVERTIME 1 24 PERIOD
   POLLUTID PM10
   RUNORNOT RUN
CO FINISHED

SO STARTING
** Dryer stack (POINT): Qs(g/s) Hs(m) Ts(K) Vs(m/s) Ds(m)
   LOCATION DRYER    POINT     0.0     0.0   0.0
   SRCPARAM DRYER    2.5  30.0  420.0  15.0  1.2
** Crusher building vent (VOLUME): Qs(g/s) Hrel(m) Syinit(m) Szinit(m)
   LOCATION CRUSHER  VOLUME   60.0   -40.0   0.0
   SRCPARAM CRUSHER  0.16  5.0  4.65  4.65
** Storage pile (AREA, SW corner): Qs(g/s/m2) Hrel(m) Xinit(m) Yinit(m) Angle(deg)
   LOCATION PILE     AREA   -150.0  -100.0   0.0
   SRCPARAM PILE     4.0E-6  3.0  80.0  50.0  0.0
** Haul road (LINE): Qs(g/s/m2) Hrel(m) Width(m)
   LOCATION ROAD     LINE   -200.0   150.0   200.0   150.0   0.0
   SRCPARAM ROAD     2.0E-6  1.5  10.0
   SRCGROUP STACKS   DRYER
   SRCGROUP FUGITIVE CRUSHER PILE ROAD
   SRCGROUP ALL
SO FINISHED

RE STARTING
   GRIDCART GRID1 STA
                  XYINC  -1000.0  21  100.0  -1000.0  21  100.0
   GRIDCART GRID1 END
** Nearest house and a school
   DISCCART   450.0   300.0
   DISCCART  -600.0  -350.0
RE FINISHED

ME STARTING
   SURFFILE AERMET2.SFC
   PROFFILE AERMET2.PFL
   SURFDATA 14735 1988 ALBANY,NY
   UAIRDATA 14735 1988 ALBANY,NY
   PROFBASE 0.0 METERS
ME FINISHED

OU STARTING
   RECTABLE ALLAVE FIRST-SECOND
   MAXTABLE ALLAVE 10
   PLOTFILE 1      ALL      FIRST pm10_1hr_all.plt
   PLOTFILE 24     ALL      FIRST pm10_24hr_all.plt
   PLOTFILE PERIOD ALL            pm10_period_all.plt
   PLOTFILE PERIOD STACKS         pm10_period_stacks.plt
   PLOTFILE PERIOD FUGITIVE       pm10_period_fugitive.plt
   SUMMFILE practice_quarry.sum
OU FINISHED
